Package: simple-vpn
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/Yaman-khalid/personal-simple_vpn-
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi (>= 3.48), gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.14), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-nm-1.0 (>= 1.46), gir1.2-secret-1, network-manager (>= 1.46), network-manager-openvpn-gnome
Recommends: gnome-keyring
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Personal desktop interface for Proton OpenVPN configurations
 Import an OpenVPN configuration, enter Proton OpenVPN credentials,
 and connect through NetworkManager from a native GTK interface.
 Passwords can optionally be remembered in the desktop keyring.
 .
 No kill switch or independent IP/DNS leak test is included.
 Intended for Ubuntu 24.04 with GNOME and NetworkManager.
